   Paper: "DFlash: Block Diffusion for Flash Speculative Decoding", Chen et al.,
   arXiv:2602.06036.

2. sgl-project/sglang - the DFlash 2 components, grouped dynamic convolution and
   candidate selector (Apache License 2.0).
   Files: srt/models/dflash.py, srt/speculative/dflash_worker_v2.py

3. ARahim3/mlx-dspark - the MLX reference this port was written against
